7,"name":"Asmik Ace"},{"animation":false,"id":757,"name":"Sony Music Entertainment"},{"animation":true,"id":765,"name":"Sakura Create"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"The premise of the project is the 70% possibility that a magnitude 7.0 earthquake will occur in Tokyo in the next 30 years. The anime depicts what would happen if an 8.0 earthquake took place.\n\nThe story centers on Mirai, a middle school freshman girl who goes to Tokyo’s artificial Odaiba Island for a robot exhibition with her brother Yuuki at the start of summer vacation. A powerful tremor emanates from an ocean trench, the famed Tokyo Tower and Rainbow Bridge crumble and fall, and the landscape of Tokyo changes in an instant. With the help of a motorcycle delivery woman named Mari who they meet on Odaiba, Mirai and Yuuki strive to head back to their Setagaya home in western Tokyo."},"tags":[{"name":"Urban","rank":96,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Survival","rank":91,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Child Cast","rank":89,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":86,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Natural Disaster","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Rescue","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ghost","rank":73,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Post-Apocalyptic","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Eco-Horror","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"CGI","rank":57,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Military","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Robots","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":33,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Motorcycles","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Tokyo Magnitude 8.0","english":"Tokyo Magnitude 8.0","native":"東京マグニチュード8.0","romaji":"Tokyo Magnitude 8.0","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"东京地震8.0"}]},"trailer":{"id":"0VyViKOvLdM","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.